# Large IQ recordings are hosted on Cloudflare R2, not git (see
# scripts/r2-cors.json and the deploy workflow). The tiny .sigmf-meta sidecars
# ARE committed -- the site build reads them to build the recordings manifest
# (datatype/sample-rate/etc.) on CI, where the data files are absent.
# The ** covers collections kept in a sub-directory (example_recordings/estevez/).
/example_recordings/**/*.sigmf-data
